&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to the above technical skills, Akuna&amp;nbsp;values diversity of experience and perspective. We believe that&amp;nbsp;engineers with&amp;nbsp;varied backgrounds and interests allow&amp;nbsp;us to&amp;nbsp;approach problems from&amp;nbsp;unique&amp;nbsp;angles&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;uncover innovative,&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;solutions.&amp;nbsp;We want everyone to feel empowered to apply; we welcome your application, and we strongly encourage you to take the first steps in joining us&amp;nbsp;in the future!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;**Resumes must be&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;in PDF format.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;By&amp;nbsp;applying&amp;nbsp;to this role, you are&amp;nbsp;indicating&amp;nbsp;this is your top preference and acknowledge you will not be considered for other Quant and/or Tech roles at&amp;nbsp;Akuna&amp;nbsp;this recruiting season. This acknowledgement does not limit applications to Trading roles - in addition to this role, you may apply to any Trader roles of interest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;We are an AI-friendly company and encourage employees to leverage AI in their daily work. However, AI assistance is not permitted during interviews or assessments&lt;span data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;. Our interview process is designed to evaluate your individual skills and judgment&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;and the use of AI tools will result in disqualification from the hiring process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In accordance with&amp;nbsp;the Illinois&amp;nbsp;Equal Pay Act, the&amp;nbsp;minimum&amp;nbsp;annualized base salary starts at $145,000. Exact compensation offered may vary based on many factors including, but not limited to, the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and skill set. The minimum base salary&amp;nbsp;herein&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;in good faith by Akuna Capital LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Akuna Capital is an innovative trading firm with a strong focus on collaboration, cutting-edge technology, data driven solutions, and automation. We specialize in providing liquidity as an options market maker – meaning we are committed to providing competitive quotes that we are willing to both buy and sell. To do this successfully, we design and implement our own low latency technologies, trading strategies, and mathematical models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Founding Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;first conceptualized Akuna in their hometown of Sydney. They opened the firm’s first office in 2011 in the heart of the derivatives industry and the options capital of the world – Chicago. Today, Akuna is proud to operate from additional offices in Sydney, Shanghai, London, and Singapore.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:300,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:350}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you’ll do as a Project Manager at Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Project Manager will be responsible for overseeing multiple projects at once, driving timelines, motivating our teams, and achieving project execution. This person will have no problem diving in headfirst and holding employees accountable to their commitments, responsibilities, and deadlines. A technical background, or the ability to communicate effectively with technical team members, will be imperative in understanding the mechanics of putting projects together. In this role, you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;469777462&amp;quot;:[9360],&amp;quot;469777927&amp;quot;:[0],&amp;quot;469777928&amp;quot;:[4]}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
