&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;BS/MS/PhD in a technical field – Engineering, Statistics, Computer Science, Mathematics, Physics, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Understanding of advanced Mathematics: Calculus, Probability, Linear Algebra, Statistics and Optimization&lt;/li&gt;
