&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;About Akuna:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Akuna Capital is an innovative trading firm with a strong focus on collaboration,&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;technology, data driven solutions, and automation. We specialize in providing liquidity as an options market&amp;nbsp;maker, meaning we are committed to providing competitive quotes that we are willing to both buy and sell. To do this successfully, we design and implement our own low latency technologies, trading strategies, and mathematical models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Founding Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;first conceptualized Akuna in their hometown of Sydney. They opened the firm’s first office in 2011 in the heart of the derivatives industry and the options capital of the world – Chicago. Today, Akuna is proud to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;offices in Sydney, Shanghai, Singapore, and London.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;do as an Entry-Level Python Software Engineer&amp;nbsp;at Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Python&amp;nbsp;software engineers at Akuna&amp;nbsp;have the opportunity to&amp;nbsp;join either our Post Trade Technology,&amp;nbsp;Data Engineering, or Crypto&amp;nbsp;teams, working&amp;nbsp;alongside&amp;nbsp;other&amp;nbsp;software engineers and traders to design and implement elegant solutions to complex and&amp;nbsp;interesting problems.&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;use&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;technology while working on high-performance systems that process and analyze large volumes of trading and market data. We offer a team-based approach to trading and software engineering, believing that productive&amp;nbsp;integration of the two groups is vital for success in this industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Akuna is looking for software engineers who are motivated and willing to reach for creative solutions when faced with novel problems.&amp;nbsp;We value innovation and hard work and want&amp;nbsp;our engineers&amp;nbsp;to make an impact on the firm.&amp;nbsp;Whether you are&amp;nbsp;interested in trading infrastructure, algorithms, exchange gateways, or data capture and analysis,&amp;nbsp;there’s&amp;nbsp;engaging&amp;nbsp;work to be done. If you are excited to jump in and make a difference, Akuna could be the place for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
