&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;**Resumes must be&amp;nbsp;submitted&amp;nbsp;in PDF format.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In addition to the above technical skills, Akuna&amp;nbsp;values diversity of experience and perspective. We believe that&amp;nbsp;engineers with&amp;nbsp;varied backgrounds and&amp;nbsp;interests allow&amp;nbsp;us to&amp;nbsp;approach problems from&amp;nbsp;unique&amp;nbsp;angles&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;uncover innovative,&amp;nbsp;optimal&amp;nbsp;solutions.&amp;nbsp;We want everyone to feel empowered to apply; we welcome your application, and we strongly encourage you to take the first steps in joining us&amp;nbsp;in the future!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;By applying to this role, you are&amp;nbsp;indicating&amp;nbsp;this is your top preference and acknowledge you will not be considered for other Quant and/or Tech roles at&amp;nbsp;Akuna&amp;nbsp;this recruiting season. This acknowledgement does not limit applications to Trading roles - in addition to this role, you may apply to any Trader roles of&amp;nbsp;interest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;We are an AI-friendly company and encourage employees to leverage AI in their daily work. However, AI assistance is not permitted during interviews or assessments&lt;span data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;. Our interview process is designed to evaluate your individual skills and judgment&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;and the use of AI tools will result in disqualification from the hiring process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In accordance with&amp;nbsp;the Illinois Equal Pay Act, the&amp;nbsp;minimum&amp;nbsp;annualized base salary starts at $145,000. Exact compensation offered may vary based on many factors including, but not limited to, the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and skill set. The minimum base salary&amp;nbsp;herein&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;in good faith by Akuna Capital LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
