&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;By&amp;nbsp;applying&amp;nbsp;to this role, you are&amp;nbsp;indicating&amp;nbsp;this is your top preference and acknowledge you will not be considered for other Quant and/or Tech roles at&amp;nbsp;Akuna&amp;nbsp;this recruiting season. This acknowledgement does not limit applications to Trading roles - in addition to this role, you may apply to any Trader roles of interest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;We are an AI-friendly company and encourage employees to leverage AI in their daily work. However, AI assistance is not permitted during interviews or assessments&lt;span data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;. Our interview process is designed to evaluate your individual skills and judgment&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;and the use of AI tools will result in disqualification from the hiring process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;In accordance with&amp;nbsp;the Illinois&amp;nbsp;Equal Pay Act, the&amp;nbsp;minimum&amp;nbsp;annualized base salary starts at $145,000. Exact compensation offered may vary based on many factors including, but not limited to, the candidate’s experience, qualifications, and skill set. The minimum base salary&amp;nbsp;herein&amp;nbsp;was&amp;nbsp;determined&amp;nbsp;in good faith by Akuna Capital LLC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Akuna:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Akuna Capital is an innovative trading firm with a strong focus on collaboration,&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;technology, data driven solutions, and automation. We specialize in providing liquidity as an options market&amp;nbsp;maker,&amp;nbsp;meaning we are committed to providing competitive quotes that we are willing to both buy and sell. To do this successfully, we design and implement our own low latency technologies, trading strategies, and mathematical models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Founding Partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;first conceptualized Akuna in their hometown of Sydney. They opened the firm’s first office in 2011 in the heart of the derivatives industry and the options capital of the world – Chicago. Today, Akuna is proud to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;from&amp;nbsp;additional&amp;nbsp;offices in Sydney, Shanghai, Singapore, and London.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you’ll&amp;nbsp;do as a Python Software Engineer Intern at Akuna:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking Python Software Engineer Interns to join our innovative and growing technology team for our 10-week&amp;nbsp;Akunacademy&amp;nbsp;internship program. In this role, you will join either our Post Trade Technology or Data Engineering teams and work alongside software engineers and traders to design and implement elegant solutions to complex and interesting problems.&amp;nbsp;Each intern takes full ownership of their project, and at the end of the program, has the opportunity to present their work and accomplishments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Python Software Engineer Interns at Akuna have the opportunity to use cutting-edge technology while working on&amp;nbsp;high-performance systems that process and analyze&amp;nbsp;large&amp;nbsp;volumes of trading and market data.&amp;nbsp;We offer a team-based approach to trading and software engineering, believing that productive integration of the two groups is vital for success in this industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Akuna is looking for&amp;nbsp;software&amp;nbsp;engineer interns who are motivated and willing to reach for creative solutions when faced with novel problems.&amp;nbsp;We value innovation and hard work and want&amp;nbsp;our engineers&amp;nbsp;to make an impact on the firm.&amp;nbsp;Whether you are&amp;nbsp;interested in trading infrastructure, algorithms, exchange gateways, or data capture and analysis,&amp;nbsp;there’s&amp;nbsp;engaging&amp;nbsp;work to be done. If you are excited to jump in and make a difference, Akuna could be the place for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
